OL,3,GNEWSAMurder arrest after man's body
OL,4,Afound in village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 31-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder following the
OL,8,Fdiscovery of a body in a village.
OL,10,FSuffolk Police said a man in his 30s
OL,11,Fwas found dead at a property in
OL,12,FBromeswell, near Woodbridge, early on
OL,13,FSaturday.
OL,15,FOfficers were called to the address in
OL,16,FSummer Lane by ambulance staff at 12:52
OL,17,FBST.
OL,19,FThe suspect was arrested later that
OL,20,Fafternoon and taken to Martlesham
OL,21,FPolice Investigation Centre for
OL,22,Fquestioning.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
